sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User (Browser/SPA)
    participant API as NativeAuthEndpoints
    participant SU as SignUpFlowService
    participant NC as NativeAuthClient
    participant CIAM as Entra External ID (CIAM)

    U->>API: POST /api/auth/native/signup/start {email, password}
    API->>SU: SignUpStartAsync(email, password)
    SU->>NC: signup/v1.0/start
    NC->>CIAM: start
    CIAM-->>NC: continuation_token
    NC->>CIAM: signup/v1.0/challenge
    CIAM-->>NC: challenge_type = "oob" (email OTP)
    NC-->>SU: OtpChallenge
    SU-->>API: SignUpStartResult.OtpChallenge
    API-->>U: 200 OtpChallengeResponse

    Note over U,CIAM: user checks email for the one-time code

    U->>API: POST /api/auth/native/signup/verify-email {continuationToken, code}
    API->>SU: VerifyEmailAsync(token, code)
    SU->>NC: signup/v1.0/continue (grant_type=oob)
    NC->>CIAM: continue
    CIAM-->>NC: continuation_token (verified)
    NC->>CIAM: oauth2/v2.0/token (grant_type=continuation_token)
    CIAM-->>NC: access_token, id_token, refresh_token
    NC-->>SU: NativeAuthTokenResult
    SU-->>API: tokens
    API-->>U: 200 AuthTokensResponse {accessToken, refreshToken, oid, ...}

    Note over U: subsequent API calls use accessToken as Bearer.<br/>Username is still empty at this point —<br/>POST /api/auth/complete-profile must be called next<br/>(see 06-authorization-and-authentication-pipeline.md)
